# Settings for tools/split_songs.py when SPEAKER=pheebie (see python tools/split_songs.py -h).
# Otherwise the defaults tuned for sakura_shunka.
# Songs under 2 minutes are dropped (decided after the spot check on 2026-10-19): among them were the
# start of each stream, halves of songs split across two parts of a recording, and short bits in chat.
--min-song 120
